        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/w/b38774/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-01-18T22:58:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So after playing all the villains quite a few times it appears to me that Citizen Dawn is the most challenging.</p>\n<p>She is very similar to Lord Voss with the minions, except on average all of hers are about twice as powerful as his. He has Forced Deployment, but her ongoing and one-shots are just vicious. I inevitably flip her a few rounds in and by the time I get her to flip back my heroes HPs are cut in half, and she is close to full health.</p>\n<p>I typically play a four man team of Legacy, Tempest, Fanatic, and either Haka or Ra. Same group that I used to bring down Voss pretty handily.</p>\n<p>I’m interested to hear what other folks think. Is she the toughest? Am I probably doing it wrong?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:35:08.076Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
