        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/w/b38774/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-01-19T05:23:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;Spiff&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"Spiff\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>You’re not doing it wrong.  She’s the toughest.</p>\n<p>(this topic shouldn’t be in the Rules and Gameplay section.  It’s more of a General discussion)</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I figured I’d put it under Rules and Gamplay in case folks brought up strategy or game play mechanics.</p>\n<p>I assume it it is still reasonable to take her on with four players right? Any thoughts on team make up?</p>\n<p>I haven’t embarked on an advanced rules game yet. Perhaps I’ll get around to that over the weekend.</p>",
