        "raw": "[quote=\"\"Spiff\"\"]\n\nYou're not doing it wrong.  She's the toughest.\n\n(this topic shouldn't be in the Rules and Gameplay section.  It's more of a General discussion)\n\n[/quote]\n\n\nI figured I'd put it under Rules and Gamplay in case folks brought up strategy or game play mechanics.\n\nI assume it it is still reasonable to take her on with four players right? Any thoughts on team make up?\n\nI haven't embarked on an advanced rules game yet. Perhaps I'll get around to that over the weekend.",
